13 │ # The associated types of the coroutine of a call through an instance come
14 │ # from the signature of the trait method.
15 │ def generator(k: core.Continuation[r, c]) given (co: core.Coroutine[c], _: core.Drop[c]) where (
16 │     co.Return = int32,
17 │     co.Effect = {Yield[int32]},
